<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Simulation Sciences starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Simulation Sciences starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Wednesday it had started coverage of Simulation Sciences Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was unchanged in early exchange trade at 14.</p>
